  "description": "Soaring climbs, daunting descents, techy trail features: Notch C is unshakeable. In fact, it wants more. Bosch’s latest Performance Line CX drive unit and 625Wh battery help you keep up with Notch’s trail appetite.\n\nNotch C is built on a high-modulus carbon fiber frame to shave weight and grant you the stiffness to stick to your line. Enduro-focused geometry delivers a stable ride on rowdy terrain, backed by 170mm of supportive, efficient Split Pivot rear suspension travel and a 180mm fork. And with a dedicated space for your spare tube, multi-tool, and a bottle (or range-extender battery), this carbon eMTB is equipped for tremendous trail days.\n\nSRAM’s GX Eagle Transmission drivetrain adds accurate, near-instant shifts and a durable design so you can focus on the trail. Saddle up with Notch C and charge your adventure.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
